<title>FINLAND: Finland Bank reserves down FIM 1.17 bln in week.</title>
<headline>Finland Bank reserves down FIM 1.17 bln in week.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest balance sheet for the week to March 27 showed the following positions in millions of markka compared to March 21:</p>
<p> Position						Latest    Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves				     59,700   60,873</p>
<p> Money market intervention			  18,158   18,158</p>
<p> Govt sector claims				    1,907    1,907</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims			     2,256    2,256</p>
<p> Other						     6,923    7,054</p>
<p> Total assets					    88,944  90,248</p>
<p>In the previous week, to March 21, reserves fell by 307 million markka.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 235, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
